      "text": "Checking the battery\nWhen the speaker is turned on, the battery status indicator briefly illuminates, then turns off to conserve battery power. However, if the battery requires charging, the battery status indicator illuminates and continuously blink red until the speaker the speaker is connected to AC power and the battery begins charging.\nTo check the battery charge level, press and hold Power on the speaker and observe the battery status indicator.",
